"use strict";$(document).ready(function(){var n=$("#Id").val(),t=$("#NickName").val();$("#viewhistoryjobgrade").click(function(){var i="/employee/ViewHistoryJobGrade/"+n;$.get(i,function(n){$("#dialog-show-history-jobgrade").html(n);$("#dialog-show-history-jobgrade").dialog({modal:!0,height:"auto",width:"auto",title:t+"'s Job Grade",show:{effect:"fade",duration:300},hide:{effect:"fade",duration:200}})})});$("#viewhistorymanagementgrade").click(function(){var i="/employee/ViewHistoryManagementGrade/"+n;$.get(i,function(n){$("#dialog-show-history-jobgrade").html(n);$("#dialog-show-history-jobgrade").dialog({modal:!0,height:"auto",width:"auto",title:t+"'s Management Grade",show:{effect:"fade",duration:300},hide:{effect:"fade",duration:200}})})});$(".tooltip-sd-group").tipsy({className:"tipsy-sd-group",gravity:"nw",html:!0,offset:5,title:function(){const n=$(this).attr("data-title").split(";");return"<div>"+n.map(n=>`<p>${n}</p>`).join("")+"<\/div>"}})});